{"product_id":"the-casual-vacancy","title":"The Casual Vacancy","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen Barry Fairbrother dies in his early forties, the town of Pagford is left in shock.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePagford is, seemingly, an English idyll, with a cobbled market square and an ancient abbey, but what lies behind the pretty fa ade is a town at war.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eRich at war with poor, teenagers at war with their parents, wives at war with their husbands, teachers at war with their pupils Pagford is not what it first seems.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAnd the empty seat left by Barry on the parish council soon becomes the catalyst for the biggest war the town has yet seen. Who will triumph in an election fraught with passion, duplicity and unexpected revelations?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA big novel about a small town, The Casual Vacancy is J.K. Rowling's first novel for adults. It is the work of a storyteller like no other. n fraught with passion, duplicity and unexpected revelations?\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eA big novel about a small town, The Casual Vacancy is J.K. Rowling's first novel for adults. It is the work of a storyteller like no other. \u003cbr\u003eDimensions:38 x 200 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Rowling\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFormat : Hardcover \u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780751552867 \u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":41761709719705,"sku":"8RF9780751552867","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/71joZzjLECL._SL1500.jpg?v=1722009471","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/the-casual-vacancy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}